<div class="xsto-container py-8 md:py-12 mr-discovery"><p class="mr-discovery-eyebrow">More possibilities, wherever you are</p><header class="mb-8 max-w-3xl"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://mobilityrobot.co.uk"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"International enquiries","item":"https://mobilityrobot.co.uk/pages/international"}]}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a href="/" class="hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-foreground">International enquiries</span></li></ol></nav><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-4xl">Your world. Your next move.</h1><p class="mt-3 text-lg text-muted-foreground">Interested in XSTO from outside the UK? Let’s start with your location and what you need.</p></header><div class="mr-discovery-contact-layout"><section aria-labelledby="international-process-heading"><h2 id="international-process-heading">Tell us where you want to go.</h2><p>Mobility Robot is operated by Bentech Medical Limited, the official UK distributor of XSTO. If you are outside the UK, please contact us before placing an order.</p><ol class="mr-discovery-steps"><li><h3>Your country and model.</h3><p>Tell us your destination and the chair you are interested in. Retailers can include their company name and website.</p></li><li><h3>Availability and support.</h3><p>We need to confirm supply arrangements and what local or cross-border support is available for your destination.</p></li><li><h3>A clear quote before you buy.</h3><p>Delivery options, import charges, tax treatment and warranty arrangements need to be confirmed for your country.</p></li></ol></section><aside class="mr-discovery-contact-card"><p class="mr-discovery-eyebrow">Outside the UK?</p><h2>Start an international enquiry.</h2><p>Email your country, postcode and preferred model so the team can discuss the arrangements with you.</p><a class="mr-discovery-button" href="mailto:sales@bentechmeduk.com?subject=International%20XSTO%20enquiry">Email the team <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10" /> <path d="M7 17 17 7" /></svg></a><a href="/pages/contact" class="mr-discovery-link">Use our contact form <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10" /> <path d="M7 17 17 7" /></svg></a><p class="mr-discovery-notice">Prices shown on this website are in GBP. Free UK mainland delivery and UK VAT-relief information do not describe overseas delivery or local taxes.</p></aside></div><section class="mr-discovery-cta" aria-labelledby="international-range-heading"><div><p class="mr-discovery-eyebrow">Start with the possibilities</p><h2 id="international-range-heading">Find the model that interests you.</h2><p>Compare the range before you contact our UK team.</p></div><a href="/pages/compare" class="mr-discovery-button">Compare models <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10" /> <path d="M7 17 17 7" /></svg></a></section></div>
